From 710ea5733e0e8ea7f728a8b10b2eca8469eadcdd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:20:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] thermal: Use quiet_therm as the tuna skin sensor

Xiaomi onyx (SM8735) has no sys-therm-3 thermal zone, so the HAL drops
the skin sensor and the framework gets no temperature thresholds.
quiet_therm is the skin sensor Xiaomi uses on this board.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 thermalConfig.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/thermalConfig.cpp b/thermalConfig.cpp
index 62a2959..63abbff 100644
--- a/thermalConfig.cpp
+++ b/thermalConfig.cpp
@@ -2487,7 +2487,7 @@ namespace thermal {
 	std::vector<struct target_therm_cfg> tuna_specific = {
 		{
 			TemperatureType::SKIN,
-			{ "sys-therm-3" },
+			{ "quiet_therm" },
 			"skin",
 			{
 			[LIGHT] = 48000,
-- 
